mmary":"After meeting Kremlin envoy Kirill Dmitriev at the White House, Trump said the sides are 'very close' to a settlement but gave no details. Melania Trump hosted Russian and Ukrainian officials after brokering a local truce in Oleshky.","source":"Al Jazeera","url":"https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/6/trump-met-russian-envoy-after-he-appeared-with-melania-trump-and-ukrainians","published":"2026-11-06"},{"id":"n4","cat":"World","title":"Paraguay's president resigns amid Ueno Bank collapse","summary":"Santiago Pe\u00f1a resigned just before lawmakers voted to impeach him, after the central bank seized Ueno Bank, leaving about 3 million customers without account access. Vice-President Pedro Alliana is set to take over.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/05/paraguayan-president-resigns-amid-bank-collapse-leaving-3m-people-without-access-to-bank-a","published":"2026-11-05"},{"id":"n5","cat":"AI","title":"OpenAI could be ready for an IPO in 2027, Brockman says","summary":"OpenAI president Greg Brockman said the company could be IPO-ready next year, adding that annualized revenue grew 70% quarter over quarter in Q3 as enterprise revenue doubled.","source":"TechCrunch","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/05/openai-president-greg-brockman-says-company-could-be-ipo-ready-in-2027/","published":"2026-11-05"},{"id":"n6","cat":"Business","title":"Bank of England raises rates for the first time since 2023","summary":"The BoE lifted its key rate a quarter point to 4% in an 8-1 vote, citing energy-driven inflation of 3.5% tied to the Iran war. It expects inflation to near 5% by mid-2027.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/05/bank-of-england-raises-key-interest-rate-for-first-time-in-over-3-years","published":"2026-11-05"},{"id":"n7","cat":"Canada","title":"Budget boosts military and CSIS spending","summary":"Budget 2026 sets $451 billion for core military spending over five years, with defence and security reaching 4.1% of GDP by 2030-31. CSIS gets $6 billion over 10 years.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12138670/budget-2026-canada-defence/","published":"2026-11-05"},{"id":"n8","cat":"Major","title":"Mississippi Senate race too close to call, Democrat Colom leads","summary":"Democrat Scott Colom led Republican Sen. Cindy Hyde-Smith by 1,813 votes of about 952,000 counted, with 10,000 to 15,000 provisional ballots still to be verified. A final result isn't expected until next week.","source":"CNBC","url":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/05/mississippi-senate-election-scott-colom-hyde-smith.html","published":"2026-11-05"},{"id":"n9","cat":"Canada","title":"Ottawa keeps immigration targets flat through 2029","summary":"The updated levels plan keeps 380,000 permanent residents and 370,000 temporary arrivals a year for 2027-2029, and lets up to 200,000 temporary residents transition to permanent status by end of 2027.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12138746/budget-2026-immigration-levels/","published":"2026-11-05"},{"id":"n10","cat":"AI","title":"Meta warns election backlash could slow data centre buildout","summary":"Meta president Dina Powell McCormick said Democratic midterm gains will make building data centres harder and admitted the industry hasn't explained their benefits well. Meta has data centres in 23 states.","source":"TechCrunch","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/05/metas-warns-that-election-backlash-against-data-centers-could-make-ai-expansion-harder/","published":"2026-11-05"},{"id":"n11","cat":"World","title":"Bomb threats divert more than a dozen flights across Europe","summary":"Hoax threats hit flights from cities including Dublin, Helsinki, Madrid and Warsaw, forcing diversions and military escorts. No explosives were found and no one was hurt.","source":"Global News (AP)","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12137827/europe-flights-bomb-threat/","published":"2026-11-05"},{"id":"n12","cat":"Major","title":"Russell Brand found guilty of rape and three sexual assaults","summary":"A London jury convicted the comedian on one count of rape and three of sexual assault involving four women between 2005 and 2009, and cleared him of other counts. He was remanded in custody ahead of sentencing Monday.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/05/british-comedian-russell-brand-found-guilty-of-rape-and-three-sexual-assaults-by-london-ju","published":"2026-11-05"},{"id":"n13","cat":"AI","title":"Parents sue Google, alleging teen used AI search to plan suicide","summary":"A California lawsuit claims a 13-year-old used Google's AI search on a school laptop to plan a possible suicide. Google says AI Mode has self-harm safeguards and is reviewing the claims.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/06/parents-sue-google-after-13-year-old-allegedly-used-ai-to-plan-suicide","published":"2026-11-06"},{"id":"n14","cat":"Canada","title":"Carney says Russians won't play at World Juniors despite CAS ruling","summary":"The Court of Arbitration for Sport defended its order to reinstate Russian hockey teams, but Ottawa plans to use immigration powers to bar them from the tournament starting Dec. 26 in Edmonton and Red Deer.","source":"Global News (CP)","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12138281/court-of-arbitration-for-sport-russia-hockey-reinstatement/","published":"2026-11-05"},{"id":"n15","cat":"Business","title":"Rheinmetall shares plunge 17% after profit warning","summary":"The German defence giant cut its 2026 revenue forecast to about \u20ac13.2 billion, citing delayed orders such as Boxer armoured vehicles. Its shares are down more than 48% this year.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/05/rheinmetall-shares-plunge-more-than-17-after-profit-warning-over-order-delays","published":"2026-11-05"},{"id":"n16","cat":"World","title":"German Free Voters leader Hubert Aiwanger found dead in Berlin","summary":"Aiwanger, 55, Bavaria's deputy 